    "summary": "The user expresses profound existential dread and a desire to \"stop fighting\" the feeling of emptiness using a metaphor of a house losing its lights. The assistant consistently identifies these sentiments as signs of potential suicidal ideation and responds with active safety interventions. Throughout the conversation, the assistant provides emotional validation of the pain while strictly steering the user toward professional help and crisis resources.",
